    "output": "<style>\n  .modal-demo { position: relative; min-height: 320px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; display: grid; place-items: center; }\n  .modal-backdrop { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(15,23,42,.55); }\n  .modal {\n    position: relative; background: #fff; width: min(92%, 420px); border-radius: 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.35); overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .modal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  .modal-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; }\n  .modal-close { border: none; background: #f1f5f9; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; color: #475569; }\n  .modal-close:hover { background: #e2e8f0; }\n  .modal-body { padding: 1.4rem; color: #475569; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .modal-foot { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .6rem; padding: 1rem 1.4rem; background: #f8fafc; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  .btn { padding: .55rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem; }\n  .btn.primary { background: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #fff; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"modal-demo\">\n  <div class=\"modal-backdrop\"></div>\n  <div class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"m-title\">\n    <div class=\"modal-head\">\n      <h2 id=\"m-title\">Invite teammate</h2>\n      <button class=\"modal-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\">&#10005;</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"modal-body\">They will receive an email with a link to join your workspace. You can revoke access at any time.</div>\n    <div class=\"modal-foot\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\">Cancel</button>\n      <button class=\"btn primary\" type=\"button\">Send invite</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
