    "instruction": "Build a multi-item FAQ accordion with plus/minus indicators where only one panel is open at a time using the CSS-only radio technique.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .faq { max-width: 560px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }\n  .faq-item + .faq-item { border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  .faq-item input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }\n  .faq-item label {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;\n    padding: 1rem 1.25rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;\n  }\n  .faq-item label:hover { background: #f8fafc; }\n  .faq-item label::after { content: '+'; font-size: 1.25rem; color: #2563eb; }\n  .faq-item input:checked + label::after { content: '\\2212'; }\n  .faq-answer { display: none; padding: 0 1.25rem 1.1rem; color: #475569; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .faq-item input:checked ~ .faq-answer { display: block; }\n  .faq-item input:focus-visible + label { outline: 3px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: -3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"faq\" id=\"faq1\" checked>\n    <label for=\"faq1\">How long does shipping take?</label>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">Orders ship within 24 hours; standard delivery is 3-5 business days.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"faq\" id=\"faq2\">\n    <label for=\"faq2\">Can I return an item?</label>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">Yes, returns are accepted within 30 days in original condition.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"faq-item\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" name=\"faq\" id=\"faq3\">\n    <label for=\"faq3\">Do you ship internationally?</label>\n    <div class=\"faq-answer\">We ship to over 40 countries; rates are calculated at checkout.</div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
