    "output": "<style>\n  .hero {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #312e81 55%, #4c1d95 100%);\n    color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 5rem 1.5rem 4.5rem; border-radius: 0 0 28px 28px;\n  }\n  .hero .eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); padding: .35rem .9rem; border-radius: 999px;\n  }\n  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.08; margin: 1.1rem auto .8rem; max-width: 16ch; }\n  .hero p { color: #c7d2fe; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.15rem); max-width: 54ch; margin: 0 auto 2rem; line-height: 1.65; }\n  .hero .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .85rem; justify-content: center; }\n  .hero .btn { padding: .8rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; font-size: .95rem; }\n  .hero .btn.primary { background: #fff; color: #1e3a8a; }\n  .hero .btn.primary:hover { background: #e0e7ff; }\n  .hero .btn.ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35); }\n  .hero .btn.ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.2); }\n  .hero .note { display: block; margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: .82rem; color: #a5b4fc; }\n</style>\n<section class=\"hero\">\n  <span class=\"eyebrow\">Now in public beta</span>\n  <h1>Ship interfaces your users actually enjoy</h1>\n  <p>Northwind gives your team a component library, tokens, and docs in one place so every screen stays consistent.</p>\n  <div class=\"actions\">\n    <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#\">Start free trial</a>\n    <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#\">Watch the demo</a>\n  </div>\n  <span class=\"note\">No credit card required &middot; 14-day trial</span>\n</section>"
