in the last release.</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"#\">Reply</a><a href=\"#\">Like</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"comment\">\n    <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"background:#bbf7d0;color:#166534;\">RS</div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"meta\"><strong>Ravi S.</strong><time datetime=\"2026-10-10T11:40\">20 minutes ago</time></div>\n      <p>Agreed. Can we get the same treatment for the settings screens?</p>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"#\">Reply</a><a href=\"#\">Like</a><a href=\"#\">Report</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
