    "instruction": "Create a toast notification stack in the bottom-right corner with success and error variants and a dismiss button.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .toasts { position: fixed; right: 1.25rem; bottom: 1.25rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .65rem; width: min(92%, 330px); z-index: 60; }\n  .toast {\n    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .75rem; background: #fff;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-left: 4px solid #16a34a; border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: .85rem 1rem; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.16);\n    animation: toastIn .35s cubic-bezier(.21,1.02,.73,1);\n  }\n  .toast.error { border-left-color: #dc2626; }\n  .toast .icon { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .toast .content { flex: 1; }\n  .toast strong { display: block; font-size: .88rem; color: #0f172a; }\n  .toast span { font-size: .82rem; color: #64748b; }\n  .toast .x { border: none; background: none; color: #94a3b8; cursor: pointer; font-size: .9rem; padding: 0 .15rem; }\n  .toast .x:hover { color: #0f172a; }\n  @keyframes toastIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"toasts\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications\">\n  <div class=\"toast\" role=\"status\">\n    <span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#10003;</span>\n    <div class=\"content\"><strong>Profile saved</strong><span>Your changes are live.</span></div>\n    <button class=\"x\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Dismiss notification\">&#10005;</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"toast error\" role=\"alert\">\n    <span class=\"icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#9888;</span>\n    <div class=\"content\"><strong>Payment failed</strong><span>Card ending 4242 was declined.</span></div>\n    <button class=\"x\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Dismiss notification\">&#10005;</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
