    "instruction": "Build an app shell layout with a fixed sidebar navigation, a top bar containing search and an avatar, and a main content area.",
    "output": "<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  .shell { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 230px 1fr; min-height: 100vh; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .shell .sidebar { background: #0f172a; color: #94a3b8; padding: 1.25rem .9rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .shell .sidebar .logo { color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 0 .6rem 1.25rem; }\n  .shell .sidebar a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; color: #94a3b8; text-decoration: none; padding: .6rem .75rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .93rem; margin-bottom: .2rem; }\n  .shell .sidebar a:hover { background: #1e293b; color: #e2e8f0; }\n  .shell .sidebar a.active { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .shell .sidebar .foot { margin-top: auto; font-size: .78rem; padding: .75rem; color: #475569; }\n  .shell .content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #f1f5f9; }\n  .shell .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: .75rem 1.5rem; }\n  .shell .topbar input { flex: 1; max-width: 420px; padding: .55rem .85rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .9rem; }\n  .shell .topbar .user { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .6rem; margin-left: auto; font-size: .88rem; color: #334155; }\n  .shell .topbar .user img { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: #c7d2fe; }\n  .shell main { padding: 1.75rem; }\n  .shell main h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.35rem; color: #0f172a; }\n  .shell .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }\n  .shell .cards div { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.1rem; }\n  @media (max-width: 768px) { .shell { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .shell .sidebar { display: none; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"shell\">\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"logo\">Northwind</div>\n    <a class=\"active\" href=\"#\">Overview</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Projects</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Team</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Reports</a>\n    <a href=\"#\">Settings</a>\n    <div class=\"foot\">v2.4.1</div>\n  </aside>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\">\n      <input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search projects, people...\" aria-label=\"Search\">\n      <div class=\"user\"><span>Maya Kim</span><img src=\"me.jpg\" alt=\"Profile photo of Maya Kim\"></div>\n    </header>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Overview</h1>\n      <div class=\"cards\">\n        <div><strong>Active projects</strong><p>14</p></div>\n        <div><strong>Open tasks</strong><p>86</p></div>\n        <div><strong>Team members</strong><p>9</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</div>"
