    "instruction": "Build a data table component with a toolbar holding search, filter, and export controls, striped rows, and a pagination footer.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .dt { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; max-width: 760px; }\n  .dt .toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; align-items: center; padding: .85rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #f8fafc; }\n  .dt .toolbar input { flex: 1; min-width: 180px; padding: .5rem .75rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .88rem; }\n  .dt .toolbar select { padding: .5rem .6rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .88rem; background: #fff; }\n  .dt .toolbar .export { padding: .5rem .9rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #0f172a; background: #0f172a; color: #fff; font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .dt table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .9rem; }\n  .dt th, .dt td { padding: .7rem 1rem; text-align: left; }\n  .dt thead th { font-size: .74rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: #64748b; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  .dt tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f8fafc; }\n  .dt tbody tr:hover { background: #eef2ff; }\n  .dt tbody td { border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #334155; }\n  .dt .status { font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; padding: .18rem .55rem; border-radius: 999px; }\n  .dt .status.ok { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }\n  .dt .status.warn { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }\n  .dt .status.bad { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }\n  .dt .pager { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: .7rem 1rem; font-size: .82rem; color: #64748b; }\n  .dt .pager .pages { display: flex; gap: .35rem; }\n  .dt .pager button { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: .8rem; }\n  .dt .pager button.on { background: #2563eb; border-color: #2563eb; color: #fff; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"dt\">\n  <div class=\"toolbar\">\n    <input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search invoices...\" aria-label=\"Search invoices\">\n    <select aria-label=\"Filter by status\">\n      <option>All statuses</option><option>Paid</option><option>Pending</option><option>Overdue</option>\n    </select>\n    <button class=\"export\" type=\"button\">Export CSV</button>\n  </div>\n  <table>\n    <thead><tr><th>Invoice</th><th>Customer</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr><td>#1042</td><td>Acme Co</td><td>$1,240</td><td><span class=\"status ok\">Paid</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>#1043</td><td>Globex</td><td>$860</td><td><span class=\"status warn\">Pending</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>#1044</td><td>Initech</td><td>$2,310</td><td><span class=\"status bad\">Overdue</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><td>#1045</td><td>Umbrella</td><td>$540</td><td><span class=\"status ok\">Paid</span></td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <div class=\"pager\">\n    <span>Showing 1-4 of 58</span>\n    <div class=\"pages\"><button type=\"button\">&#8249;</button><button class=\"on\" type=\"button\">1</button><button type=\"button\">2</button><button type=\"button\">3</button><button type=\"button\">&#8250;</button></div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
  },
