    "output": "<style>\n  .empty {\n    max-width: 420px; margin: 3rem auto; text-align: center; padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem;\n    border: 1px dashed #cbd5e1; border-radius: 18px; background: #f8fafc; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  }\n  .empty .art {\n    width: 96px; height: 96px; margin: 0 auto 1.25rem; border-radius: 24px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0e7ff, #c7d2fe); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 2.2rem;\n  }\n  .empty h2 { margin: 0 0 .5rem; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a; }\n  .empty p { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: #64748b; font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .empty .cta { display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; padding: .7rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; }\n  .empty .cta:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }\n  .empty .alt { display: block; margin-top: .9rem; font-size: .82rem; }\n  .empty .alt a { color: #2563eb; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"empty\" role=\"status\">\n  <div class=\"art\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#128229;</div>\n  <h2>No projects yet</h2>\n  <p>Projects keep your tasks, files, and teammates in one place. Create your first one to get rolling.</p>\n  <a class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">New project</a>\n  <span class=\"alt\">or <a href=\"#\">import from GitHub</a></span>\n</div>"
