    "instruction": "Build an activity feed component with timeline dots, actor names, action text, and timestamps.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .feed { max-width: 520px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; position: relative; padding-left: .25rem; }\n  .feed .entry { position: relative; padding: 0 0 1.5rem 2rem; }\n  .feed .entry::before {\n    content: ''; position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 6px; width: 12px; height: 12px;\n    border-radius: 50%; background: #2563eb; border: 3px solid #dbeafe; box-sizing: content-box;\n  }\n  .feed .entry::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 13px; top: 26px; bottom: 0; width: 2px; background: #e2e8f0; }\n  .feed .entry:last-child::after { display: none; }\n  .feed .entry .text { font-size: .92rem; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55; }\n  .feed .entry .text strong { color: #0f172a; }\n  .feed .entry .text a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }\n  .feed .entry .text a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n  .feed .entry time { display: block; font-size: .78rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: .25rem; }\n  .feed .entry.system::before { background: #f59e0b; border-color: #fef3c7; }\n  .feed .entry .chip { display: inline-block; font-size: .72rem; background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; padding: .1rem .5rem; border-radius: 6px; margin-left: .4rem; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"feed\" aria-label=\"Activity history\">\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"text\"><strong>Maya Kim</strong> pushed 3 commits to <a href=\"#\">aurora/redesign</a><span class=\"chip\">main</span></div>\n    <time datetime=\"2026-10-10T08:30\">Today, 8:30 AM</time>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"text\"><strong>Jon Tate</strong> commented on <a href=\"#\">Task #214 - Header spacing</a></div>\n    <time datetime=\"2026-10-10T09:05\">Today, 9:05 AM</time>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry system\">\n    <div class=\"text\">Deployment <a href=\"#\">#482</a> succeeded in production</div>\n    <time datetime=\"2026-10-10T09:41\">Today, 9:41 AM</time>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"entry\">\n    <div class=\"text\"><strong>Ravi Singh</strong> moved <a href=\"#\">Task #209</a> to Review</div>\n    <time datetime=\"2026-10-10T10:22\">Today, 10:22 AM</time>\n  </div>\n</div>"
