    "instruction": "Build an order summary card with item rows, a promo field, subtotal, shipping, and a checkout button.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .order { width: 340px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.5rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(15,23,42,.06); }\n  .order h3 { margin: 0 0 1.1rem; font-size: 1.05rem; color: #0f172a; }\n  .order .line { display: flex; gap: .8rem; padding: .7rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }\n  .order .line img, .order .line .ph { width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 10px; background: #e2e8f0; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .order .line .info { flex: 1; }\n  .order .line .info strong { display: block; font-size: .88rem; color: #0f172a; }\n  .order .line .info span { font-size: .78rem; color: #94a3b8; }\n  .order .qty { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; margin-top: .35rem; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 7px; padding: .1rem .35rem; font-size: .8rem; }\n  .order .qty button { border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; padding: 0 .1rem; }\n  .order .price { font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; }\n  .order .promo { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin: 1.1rem 0; }\n  .order .promo input { flex: 1; padding: .55rem .7rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 9px; font-size: .86rem; }\n  .order .promo button { padding: .55rem .9rem; border-radius: 9px; border: 1px solid #0f172a; background: #0f172a; color: #fff; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }\n  .order .tot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: .88rem; color: #475569; margin-bottom: .45rem; }\n  .order .tot.grand { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: .8rem; margin-top: .6rem; }\n  .order .checkout { width: 100%; margin-top: 1.1rem; padding: .8rem; border: none; border-radius: 11px; background: #16a34a; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: .95rem; cursor: pointer; }\n  .order .checkout:hover { background: #15803d; }\n  .order .secure { display: block; text-align: center; font-size: .76rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: .7rem; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"order\">\n  <h3>Order summary</h3>\n  <div class=\"line\">\n    <div class=\"ph\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"info\">\n      <strong>Trail Runner shoes</strong><span>Size 42 / Slate</span>\n      <span class=\"qty\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease quantity\">-</button> 1 <button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase quantity\">+</button></span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"price\">$129.00</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"line\">\n    <div class=\"ph\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"info\">\n      <strong>Merino socks (3-pack)</strong><span>Charcoal</span>\n      <span class=\"qty\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Decrease quantity\">-</button> 2 <button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Increase quantity\">+</button></span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"price\">$38.00</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"promo\">\n    <label for=\"promo\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;\">Promo code</label>\n    <input id=\"promo\" placeholder=\"Promo code\">\n    <button type=\"button\">Apply</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tot\"><span>Subtotal</span><span>$167.00</span></div>\n  <div class=\"tot\"><span>Shipping</span><span>$8.50</span></div>\n  <div class=\"tot\"><span>Estimated tax</span><span>$13.36</span></div>\n  <div class=\"tot grand\"><span>Total</span><span>$188.86</span></div>\n  <button class=\"checkout\" type=\"button\">Checkout</button>\n  <span class=\"secure\">Secured with 256-bit SSL encryption</span>\n</div>"
